  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Killem.jpg\" title=\"Kill'em Klarkzon and his Groupies\"><img alt=\"Kill'em Klarkzon and his Groupies\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"292\" src=\"/images/Killem.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Killem.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Kill'em Klarkzon and his Groupies</div></div></div>\n<p>Kill'em Klarkson is a hero found in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Deathtroit</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a> Level 1.  He is accompanied by three Champion Groupies.  He is the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Idolatry_of_Kill'em_Klarkzon\" title=\"Idolatry of Kill'em Klarkzon\">Idolatry of Kill'em Klarkzon</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
